# Koro — Multilingual & Indigenous Language Platform

## 1. Project Summary

Koro is a multilingual language and indigenous-language preservation platform.

The system allows users to:

* Translate words and sentences between languages
* Learn indigenous/local languages
* Search vocabulary
* Save favorite words and translations
* Take pictures and identify objects
* Get object names in different languages
* Build a personal saved-language collection
* Export saved vocabulary as a PDF/book
* View personal activity history
* Track activities by day, month, year, and custom date range

The platform also includes an **Admin Dashboard** where administrators can manage languages, vocabulary, translations, users, image-recognition results, and approval requests.

