# 14. User Submission & Approval System

This is very important for indigenous-language data.

Users should be able to submit new translations.

Example:

```text
Concept:
Tree

Language:
Chakma

Suggested Translation:
[translation]

Pronunciation:
[pronunciation]

Submitted By:
User A

Status:
PENDING
```

It should NOT immediately become an official translation.

Workflow:

```text
USER
 ↓
Submit Translation
 ↓
PENDING
 ↓
ADMIN / LANGUAGE REVIEWER
 ↓
Review
 ├── APPROVE
 └── REJECT
```

Only approved translations become official.

